      "content": "hey, i'm working on some material for a roast-style monologue for a late night show. i need help with some observational satire. basically, i want to look at the funny cultural differences between different groups of people—like how they act or their different habits. can you help me come up with some jokes that poke fun at those kinds of cultural contrasts? nothing too dark, just lighthearted stuff about how people from different backgrounds do things differently.",
